    "text": "<p>Overall cell reaction :-</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>aq</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>&#10230;</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>aq</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>aq</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo></msubsup></math></p><p>Using Nernst equation:<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mtext>Cell&#160;</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mtext>Cathode&#160;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mtext>anode&#160;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>059</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>log</mi><mfrac><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mfenced><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1115</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>059</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>log</mi><mfrac><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mfenced><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</m